.TH TONGS-DESKTOP 1 "September 2026" "Tongs @DESKTOP_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tongs-desktop \- launch the Tongs desktop application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tongs-desktop
.SH DESCRIPTION
Launches the packaged Tongs Electron application with Fedora system Python and
the matching packaged Tongs core. The command accepts no arguments.
